WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:16.407
Phunziroli likuyerekezera mmene ana a maso amayankhira kuwala.

00:00:16.407 --> 00:00:32.813
Chitsanzo choyamba chikusonyeza kuyankha bwino diso likaunikiridwa mwachindunji.

00:00:32.813 --> 00:00:49.220
M'zitsanzo zotsatira, yerekezerani mmene mwana wa diso akusinthira kukula akaunikiridwa.
